   "text": "Chris Mooney was a finalist in the The Great Designer Search 3 in 2018 , where they finished in third place. That same year, they started worked for Wizards of the Coast and now have risen to Principal Game Designer for Magic: The Gathering .",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "In August 2018, Mooney became a design contractor for Wizards of the Coast . A year later, they earned a full time contract. Since January 2026, they are Principal Game Designer.",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "R&D"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mooney wrote the Planeswalker's Guides to Eldraine and Ikoria . They are the current Council of Colors representative for Black .",
